        "original_id": "e51b5c73-6b1c-5bf6-a6f6-1ed706a73cdc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jerry Abbott, Vinnie Paul, Dimebag Darrell, Vincent Paul Abbott\n- Organizations: Pantera\n- Products: Metal Magic\n- Roles: drummer, producer, songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Vincent Paul Abbott, also known as Vinnie Paul, was born on March 11, 1964.\n- Vinnie Paul is an American professional drummer and producer.\n- Vinnie Paul was a co-founder and former member of the heavy metal band Pantera.\n- Metal Magic was released on Pantera's own label, which was also called Metal Magic.\n- Jerry Abbott produced Metal Magic under the alias \"The Eldn'.\"\n- Jerry Abbott was a noted country music songwriter and producer.\n- Jerry Abbott was the father of Dimebag Darrell and Vinnie Paul.\n- At the time Metal Magic was released, Dimebag Darrell was sixteen years old and Vinnie Paul was nineteen years old.",
